      "title": "extcap: Scrub our SSH credentials before freeing them",
      "message": "extcap: Scrub our SSH credentials before freeing them\n\nIt seems unlikely that we would run into a case where we would disclose\nour SSH credentials, since any action that would result in disclosure\n(e.g. dissecting a capture file) would immediately clobber the\ncredentials we just freed, but it doesn't hurt to be safe.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2026-07-07T14:00:48.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "Gerald Combs",
